OL,3,GNEWSABuyer hit with costs as planning
OL,4,Adelay stops move
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man said he has faced unexpected
OL,7,Fcosts after pulling out of buying a
OL,8,Fshared-ownership home because he was
OL,9,Funable to move in as the developer had
OL,10,Fnot fulfilled planning conditions.
OL,12,FSimon Hawking, 49, who lives in Milton
OL,13,FKeynes, planned to move into a
OL,14,Ftwo-bedroom house that was part of the
OL,15,FProspect Place development in Rushden,
OL,16,FNorthamptonshire, in March.
OL,18,FNorth Northamptonshire Council said the
OL,19,Fdevelopment was subject to a number of
OL,20,Fconditions such as improving roads.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
