OL,3,GNEWSABuyer hit with costs as planning
OL,4,Adelay stops move
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project's developer Vistry said:
OL,7,F"While a significant number of homes
OL,8,Fhave now been built, they cannot be
OL,9,Foccupied until the outstanding
OL,10,Fpre-occupation planning requirements
OL,11,Fhave been satisfied."
